-# LAF-USB Universal Sync Bus Protocol Framework
+# Universal Sync Bus Protocol Framework
 
 This is the staged framework for the Universal Sync Bus. It is not a
 delete-capable sync contract and does not reprovision the disabled Project
 Courier path.
@@
 Toolbox carriers carry external payloads.
 
+## Wiki Disambiguation
+
+This file defines the protocol framework for [[Universal Sync Bus]]. It does
+not redefine the existing [[LAF-USB]] team/migration node. Use [[USB]] when the
+acronym itself is ambiguous, and use the expanded term on first reference when
+writing durable doctrine or manifests.
+
 ## LAF-USB Naming Boundary
 
 `LAF-USB` already has live meaning in the vault. The current migration context
*** Add File: C:\Users\loganf\Documents\IDAHO-VAULT-pushable\USB.md
+---
