+---
+
+# USB - Disambiguation
+
+`USB` is an acronym collision inside the vault. Do not infer meaning from the
+letters alone.
+
+| Term | Meaning | Canonical note |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Universal Sync Bus | Vault transport/reference protocol for external objects and carrier lanes | [[Universal Sync Bus]] / [[LAF-USB-PROTOCOL-FRAMEWORK]] |
+| LAF-USB | LAF-US team/migration label under the LAF-PUBLIC team topology | [[LAF-USB]] / [[!-LAF-USB-FIVE-CORES-MIGRATION-2026-04-15]] |
+| Universal Serial Bus | Hardware/local-machine USB bus context | Use explicit prose unless a dedicated hardware note exists |
+
+Use the expanded term on first reference. Use aliases and wikilinks for graph
+resolution instead of forcing every acronym to be globally unique.
+
+## DOCUMENT METADATA
+
+- **Created:** 2026-05-08
+- **Last Updated:** 2026-05-08
+- **Status:** Active
+- **Authority:** LOGAN
+- **Change Note:** Added Obsidian-native disambiguation for the USB acronym.
