+---
+title: "Jupyter Notebooks"
+updated: 2026-05-08
+status: active
+authority: "LOGAN"
+aliases:
+  - Notebook Index
+  - Jupyter Notebook Index
+related:
+  - VAULT-CONVENTIONS
+  - LLM-Router
+  - Universal Sync Bus
+---
+
+# Jupyter Notebooks
+
+This note is the Markdown index for durable root-level Jupyter notebooks. The
+notebooks are executable/literate surfaces; this Markdown note gives Obsidian a
+human-readable index, aliases, links, and governance context.
+
+| Notebook | Markdown role | Status |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [LLM-Router.ipynb](LLM-Router.ipynb) | Local Ollama/OpenRouter routing diagnostic and runnable prototype | staged |
+| [StabilizationSystem.ipynb](StabilizationSystem.ipynb) | Stabilization notebook captured from prior agent work | needs review |
+| [Untitled.ipynb](Untitled.ipynb) | Unclassified notebook payload | needs classification |
+
+Durable notebook work should either have its own Markdown companion note or be
+listed here with enough context that the vault graph can identify what the
+notebook is for.
+
+## DOCUMENT METADATA
+
+- **Created:** 2026-05-08
+- **Last Updated:** 2026-05-08
+- **Status:** Active
+- **Authority:** LOGAN
+- **Change Note:** Added Markdown index for root-level Jupyter notebooks.
*** End Patch
