eed, and threshold context after salvage\n- pin restored GitHub Actions references to full commit SHAs\n- repair policy workflows and CodeQL language matrix\n- add pytest to dev dependencies and record Arborscape census\n\nVerification:\n- uv run pytest -q: 102 passed in IDAHO-VAULT-pushable\n- uv run ruff check src/idaho_vault .github/scripts/daily_rollover.py: passed\n- date-placeholder backlog check: passed\n- unpinned actions scan: passed\n'@\n$commit = $message | git @gitBase commit-tree $tree -p $parent\n\"COMMIT=$commit\"","workdir":"C:\\tmp\\IDAHO-VAULT-arborscape-commit","timeout_ms":120000} thread_id=019e046d-ea5f-7461-b868-9e56dd36a4b5
